           <t indent="0" pn="section-3.2.6-2">The Augmented Response Block is flexible for various purposes such as
 providing diagnosis information (see Section 7) and protocol
 verification.  Its Type field is 0x05, and its format is as follows:</t>
-          <t indent="0" pn="section-3.2.6-3"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
+          <artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt="" pn="section-3.2.6-3"><![CDATA[
